Text-to-speech components
------------------------------------------------------------------------

Kokoro-82M model weights (kokoro-v1.0.fp16.onnx, voices-v1.0.bin)
    Copyright 2024 hexgrad — Apache License 2.0.
    Downloaded at runtime to the user's model cache; not vendored here.

misaki — grapheme-to-phoneme for Kokoro
    Copyright 2025 hexgrad — Apache License 2.0.
    Used as the sole G2P. Its optional espeak fallback (`misaki.espeak`,
    which requires the GPL phonemizer + espeak-ng) is NEVER imported;
    `nightjar_capabilities/tts_g2p.py` supplies a non-GPL fallback instead.

Kokoro phoneme vocabulary (`nightjar_capabilities/kokoro_vocab.json`)
    Extracted verbatim from kokoro-onnx's `DEFAULT_VOCAB`
    (https://github.com/thewh1teagle/kokoro-onnx), Copyright (c) 2024
    thewh1teagle — MIT License. Vendored as data so the kokoro-onnx package
    (whose Tokenizer loads a GPL espeak-ng binary via ctypes) is not a
    dependency.

en_core_web_sm — spaCy English pipeline used by misaki for POS tagging
    Copyright 2016 ExplosionAI GmbH — MIT License.

Nightjar previously depended on phonemizer-fork (GPL-3.0-or-later) and
espeakng-loader (a compiled espeak-ng binary shipped with its license notices
stripped) via kokoro-onnx. Both have been removed; see
`tests/test_tts_no_gpl.py` for the regression guard that keeps them out.
